The '''Guavian Drift''', also known as '''Guavian Death Space''' or simply '''Guavian space''', was a region of [[Realspace|space]] in the [[Meram sector]] of the [[Outer Rim Territories]] region of [[the galaxy]].<ref name="Encyclopedia" /> It was controlled by the [[Guavian Death Gang]]. An [[Asteroid field|asteroid]] [[Guavian space asteroid field|field]] was located on one edge of the region. During the [[First Order-Resistance War]], the ''[[Colossus]]'' refueling station passed through Guavian space, and fought a [[Skirmish in Guavian Death Space|skirmish]] with Guavian forces inside the asteroid field, which they had traveled through in an attempt to remain unnoticed.<ref name="Kaz's Curse" />

